1. The computational cost and overhead have not been clearly discussed; 
2. The reliance on IF is questionable, as some of works point out IF for LLM is not very reliable; 
3. The experiments are confined to fine-tuning. The approach's feasibility for large-scale pre-training, especially for computationally heavy estimators like IF, is not demonstrated; 
4. The technical novelty is limited, as the proposed method is a simple combination of data selection and Bayesian optimization;
